# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [3.1.1] - 2026-01-09

### Fixed
- **Alias Integration**: Fixed alias files not being sourced in .zshrc
- **Plugin Loading**: Ensure services.zsh loads for database plugins

## [3.1.0] - 2026-01-09

### Added
- **Database Services** (Cross-platform: macOS/Linux/Windows)
  - MongoDB Community (`mongo-start`, `mongo-stop`, `mongo-local`)
  - PostgreSQL (`pg-start`, `pg-stop`, `pg-local`, `pg-list`)
  - MySQL (`mysql-start`, `mysql-stop`, `mysql-local`)
  - Redis (`redis-start`, `redis-stop`, `redis-ping`)
  - RabbitMQ (`rabbitmq-start`, `rabbitmq-queues`)
  - Elasticsearch (`es-start`, `es-health`, `es-indices`)
  - Memcached (`memcached-start`, `mc-stats`)

- **Cloud CLI Tools**
  - AWS CLI (`aws-whoami`, `aws-profile`, `ec2-list`, `s3-ls`)
  - Google Cloud (`gc-auth`, `gc-vms`, `gc-buckets`)
  - Azure CLI (`az-login`, `az-vms`, `az-aks`)

- **DevOps Tools**
  - Kubernetes (`kgp`, `kgs`, `kctx`, `kns`, `klogs`)
  - Docker Compose Extended (`dcu`, `dcd`, `dcl`, `dcps`)
  - Terraform Extended (`tfi`, `tfp`, `tfa`, `tfw`)
  - Ansible (`ap`, `av`, `ag`, `aping`)

- **Development Languages**
  - Python/venv (`venv-create`, `va`, `vd`, `pip-freeze`)
  - Golang (`gob`, `gor`, `got`, `gomod`)
  - Rust/Cargo (`cb`, `cr`, `ct`, `cf`)
  - Node/NPM/Yarn/PNPM (`ni`, `nr`, `yi`, `pi`)
  - Java/Maven/Gradle (`mci`, `gwb`, `java11`, `java17`)

- **Productivity Tools**
  - Git Extras (`gst`, `grbi`, `gcp`, `gundo`, `gsync`)
  - SSH Manager (`ssh-keygen-ed`, `ssh-copy-key`, `ssh-agent-start`)
  - Dotenv Loader (`dotenv`, `env-load`, `env-show`)
  - Directory Shortcuts (`..`, `...`, `mkcd`, `bookmark`, `goto`)
  - History Search (`hg`, `fh`, `htop10`)
  - Extract Plugin (`extract`, `mktar`, `mkzip`)

- **Service Manager Framework**: Cross-platform service management (Homebrew/systemd/Windows)

### Changed
- Updated README with complete plugin documentation
- Reorganized config.js with categorized plugins

## [3.0.0] - 2024-12-19

### Added
- **Plugin Update Manager**: Auto-update installed plugins with rollback support
- **Configuration Profiles**: Save, switch, and export different setups
- **Custom Plugin Support**: Add plugins from any Git repository
- **System Integration**: macOS/Linux optimizations and terminal integration
- **Enhanced Alias Manager**: Comprehensive development shortcuts
- **Oh My Zsh Auto-Installation**: Automatic prerequisite setup

### Fixed
- **Plugin Repository Mappings**: Corrected incorrect plugin URLs
- **Installation Validation**: Added success/failure tracking
- **Error Handling**: Comprehensive error recovery throughout
- **Backup System**: Automatic .zshrc backup before modifications
- **Command Execution**: Improved async handling and status returns

### Changed
- **Setup Script**: Completed missing functions and improved security
- **User Interface**: Enhanced CLI with new menu options
- **Documentation**: Completely rewritten README with better structure
- **Code Quality**: Added proper validation and error handling

### Security
- Added installation verification and backup systems
- Improved error recovery and rollback mechanisms

## [2.0.1] - 2024-09-06

- Update Contributing & README files style spacing
- Add function to install npm dependencies
- Remove duplicated message

## [2.0.0] - 2024-09-05

- **Major refactor** of the project structure
- Removed `awesome-lazy-zsh.js`
- Updated `package.json` to reflect the new structure
- Reduced dependencies to only `chalk` and `prompts`
- Updated README and contributing guidelines

## [1.0.2] - 2024-08-16

- Added `repository`, `homepage`, `bugs`, and `bin` fields in `package.json`
- Improved keywords and added a `start` script
- Updated README with new instructions

## [1.0.1] - 2024-08-15

- Added support for Starship and Spaceship themes
- Improved error handling in the setup script

## [1.0.0] - 2024-08-14

- Initial release with default and custom installation options
